a phase-parent goal.md binding five child goals, offered to the operator to set. | Not stated. | None | goal.md |\n44:| Q008 | Code is implemented by DeepSeek V4.1 Flash at max reasoning through the dsh harness (or Pi with the OpenCode Go provider), never by Fable. Fable through claude2 stays allowed for documents. | Not stated. | None ","truncated":true}
