{"type":"tool_result","callId":"chatcmpl-tool-888e7bdb4cdf5759","status":"completed","result":"=== relocate size ===\n    1826 .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/relocate.mjs\n=== relocate exit codes/usage ===\n5:// Moves, renumbers or re-parents spec packets and leaves every store that\n19:// --apply of an applied map finds nothing to do.\n28://   node .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/relocate.mjs --renumber <folder> [--apply]\n67:  validate: path.join(SCRIPT_DIR, 'validate.sh'),\n68:  migrate: path.join(SKILL_ROOT, 'runtime/cli/graph/migrate-generated-json.ts'),\n73:const LEDGER = path.join(REPO, '.skilled/skills/sk-doc/shared/scripts/relocation-ledger.json');\n76:// The steps after the ledger write whose work lives outside the packet tree.\n77:// Each passing step marks its ledger batch, so a rerun can tell which one\n78:// stopped the earlier run and finish it instead of finding nothing to do.\n101:// owns that row after a move; the reference pass writes it too, so a bare old\n115:const USAGE = `Usage: relocate.mjs (--map <file.json> | --from <path> --to <path> | --renumber <folder> | --declare-subtrack <track>/<name>) [--apply]`;\n236:  const failed = result.error || result.status !== 0;\n239:    status: result.status,\n242:    why: result.error ? result.error.message : `exit ${result.status}`,\n255:  const options = { apply: false, map: null, from: null, to: null, renumber: null, declare: null };\n256:  const valued = new Map([['--map', 'map'], ['--from', 'from'], ['--to', 'to'], ['--renumber', 'renumber'], ['--declare-subtrack', 'declare']]);\n263:      process.exit(0);\n275:  const modes = [options.map !== null, options.from !== null || options.to !== null, options.renumber !== null, options.declare !== null].filter(Boolean).length;\n276:  if (modes !== 1) throw new UsageError('name exactly one of --map, --from with --to, --renumber or --declare-subtrack');\n341:// order. Numbers held in the folder's z_archive count as taken, so