ed: \"2026-11-13\"\n5:version: 2.1.25.0\n=== source feature line nums ===\n    20\t\n    21\t---\n    22\t\n    23\t## 2. HOW IT WORKS\n    24\t\n    25\t### Modes\n    26\t\n    27\tThe tool runs from the repository root and takes exactly one mode. Paths are relative to the specs root, and a leading `specs/` is accepted.\n    28\t\n    29\t| Mode | What it does |\n    30\t|---|---|\n    31\t| `--map <file.json>` | Applies a","truncated":true}
