--include-archive`. Render `[archived]` when it is `true`. The path-only recipe returns plain path strings with no such field |\n.skilled/commands/speckit/assets/search-presentation.txt:128:- Render the `[archived]` label and the `json    :` section only for a run with `--include-archive`. Without the flag archived packets are not searched, the rows carry no `archived` field and the record has no `jsonLane`.\n.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-diff-confirm.yaml:349:    - \"IF the format is a text-layer PDF and no extractor is available (exit 3): do not claim a diff; offer the explicit-pair fallback with pre-extracted text\"\n.skilled/commands/create/assets/create-diff-auto.yaml:325:    - \"IF the format is a text-layer PDF and no extractor is available (exit 3): do not claim a diff; offer the explicit-pair fallback with pre-extracted text\"\n"}
