anation: 'The page may describe only the human-rendered lists and treat archivedPaths as internal, but it explicitly says the report shape is unchanged without the flag while the field is present in JSON.',\n    finalSeverity: 'P1', confidence: 0.97,\n    downgradeTrigger: 'If the field is documented in an unmodified generated reference that wrapper readers are expected to consult, downgrade to P2.',\n    case: 'A consumer reads path --json with --include-archive, looks for the archived subset in paths or results, and never sees archivedPaths; even a live-only record carries archivedPaths: [].'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'R3-P1-008', severity: 'P1', title: 'suggest-subtracks docs say three no-map cases, but a non-NNN-slug packet adds a fourth',\n    file: '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/structure/folder-structure.md:141',\n    findingClass: 'cross-consumer',\n    scopeProof: 'rg for \"prints no map in three cases\" over the changed docs finds the structure reference and the feature page; both omit the naming case. The implementation branch returns before the threshold and grouping checks.',\n    affectedSurfaceHints: ['folder-structure reference', 'sub-track feature page', 'suggest-subtracks operator guidance'],\n    claim: 'The structure reference and sub-track feature page say suggest-subtracks has exactly three no-map cases, while the implementation and phase 009 criterion add a fourth for non-NNN-slug packet folder names.',\n    evidenceRefs: ['references/structure/folder-structure.md:141','feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/sub-track-proposal.md:30','009-proposal-search-and-routing/goal.md:47','runtime/cli/spec/suggest-subtracks.mjs:293','runtime/cli/spec/suggest-subtracks.mjs:298','runtime/cli/tests/suggest-subtracks.vitest.ts:207'],\n    counterevidenceSought: 'Counted the branches in proposeRetroactive before the normal threshold and grouping checks; the misnamed branch returns first and is not one of the three listed cases.',\n    alternativeExplanation: 'The sentence may predate the phase-009 guard and the exception may be considered a validation diagnostic, but the output is still a no-map line and the tool exits 0.',\n    finalSeverity: 'P1', confidence: 0.94,\n    downgradeTrigger: 'If the docs add the misnamed-packet branch as a fourth case or explicitly defer it to a linked validation page, downgrade to P2.',\n    case: 'A track contains 003_under and enough other packets to cross the threshold; suggest-subtracks prints the misnamed line and no map, while the three-case list predicts a map.'\n  },\n  {\n    id: 'R3-P2-009', severity: 'P2', title: 'Relocation docs describe only whole-id rewrites and omit the phase-007 bare-name and pre-archive passes',\n    file: '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:44',\n    findingClass: 'cross-consumer',\n    scopeProof: 'rg for \"bare name|pre-archive|preArchive|whole old id\" over the changed docs finds the feature page whole-id sentence and no bare-name/pre-archive description; the command README also says only \"rewrites every whole old id\".',\n    affectedSurfaceHints: ['feature catalog relocation page', 'relocation command README', 'relocation test inventory'],\n    claim: 'The relocation feature page describes only whole-id rewriting, omitting the phase-007 bare-name pass and pre-archive alias, and its test table names only relocate.vitest.ts.',\n    evidenceRefs: ['007-phase-map-and-prearchive-rewrites/goal.md:44','runtime/cli/spec/relocate.mjs:680','runtime/cli/spec/relocate.mjs:1029','runtime/cli/tests/relocate.vitest.ts:328','runtime/cli/tests/archive-track.vitest.ts:176','feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:91'],\n    counterevidenceSought: 'Read the relocation transform and both tests; the bare-name and pre-archive passes are real and covered.',\n    alternativeExplanation: 'The whole-id sentence is not false, just incomplete; that is why this remains P2 rather than a P1 con