nual playbook focus says \"manual testing playbook against sk-create-manual-testing-playbook\" and \"docs stale against phases 006-010\". This is a good one. Could primary `manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:27` objective. It says only dry run/refused number/applied renumber. Phase 010 real-pipeline tests cover true writers, but manual scenario still old. P2.\nR4-P2-014: Changelog test counts and \"Five new suites ... 33 cases\" etc. not updated. P2.\n\nWe need avoid too many findings. Maybe 3 P2s in iteration 4:\n1. R4-P2-010: Changelog still describes pre-remediation state and test counts (2567 vs 2603), and version remains 2.13.0.0. This is a release-maintainability issue. P2.\n2. R4-P2-011: Command behavior is duplicated across four docs with no single source, producing inconsistent exit contracts. P2. Could be considered \"maintainability\" and actionable.\n3. R4-P2-012: Manual testing playbook scenario 492 covers only phases 001-005; none of 006-010's behaviors are exercised. P2.\n\nMaybe one P1? The user focus says highest-yield docs stale. We have enough P1s from earlier. Maintainability can be P2. Verdict remains CONDITIONAL due active P1s. Fine.\n\nNeed exact line refs:\n- Changelog test count lines 207-212. Let's read."}
