{"type":"tool_result","callId":"chatcmpl-tool-8fc364063410d755","status":"completed","result":"   200\t| `rg-wrapper.mjs path \"skill routing refactor\"` | Archived hits hidden | 10 paths, none archived |\n   201\t| The same with `--include-archive` | No such flag | 12 paths, 2 marked `[archived]`, 1 archived metadata file |\n   202\t| `validate.sh specs/sk-doc --include-archive` | No such flag | `ERROR: --include-archive requires --recursive`, exit 2 |\n   203\t| `validate.sh specs/sk-doc --recursive` | 25 results, exit 0 | The same 25 results, exit 0 |\n   204\t| The same with `--include-archive` | No such flag | 73 results, exit 2 as expected |\n   205\t| `relocate.mjs --map` on a sample map, dry run | No tool | Exit 1, `git status` unchanged |\n   206\t| The same map with `--apply` in a clone, twice | No tool | `RESULT: PASSED`, then `nothing to do` |\n   207\t| `suggest-subtracks.mjs --track system-speckit --describe \"archive a spec folder\"` | No tool | `best fit: system-speckit/spec-folder-tooling` |\n   208\t| `create.sh` beside live `001-a` and archived `007-b` | Archive not read | Created `008-next-one` |\n   209\t| `sweep-track-roots.mjs` | 40 sub-tracks with no archive | No missing-archive line, exit 0 |\n   210\t| Rows in `specs/descriptions.json` with no folder | 1334 | 0 |\n   211\t\n   212\tThe search rows, the flag error, the proposal row and the sweep were run again for this entry. The other rows come from the spec folder's records.\n   213\t\n   214\t#### Tests and Scenarios\n   215\t\n   216\t- **The full suite passed after the review fixes.** `npm test` exited 0. 211 files passed and 3 skipped. 2567 tests passed and 20 skipped, with 0 failed in every stage. Before the review fixes 2558 tests passed. The baseline was 206 files and 2524 tests.\n   217\t- **Five new suites cover the release.** They hold 33 cases for moving, proposing, numbering, archive search and archive validation.\n   218\t- **The review fixes added nine cases.** They cover the twice-named source, declaring a sub-track, a restore onto a free number and archive seeding.\n   219\t- **The whole-track map was checked on a test track only.** No real flat track holds 8 live packets. A 10-packet test track gave a 10-entry map that `relocate.mjs` accepted.\n   220\t- **The relocate suite does not run the full chain.** Six follow-up tools are stubs there. The clone run above covers the chain.\n   221\t- **A stopped `--renumber` run does not finish on a rerun.** When an applied `relocate.mjs --renumber` run stops at a later step, a rerun of `--renumber` finds no moves and exits 0. The remaining steps stay undone. Run `repair-derived.cjs` and `refresh-track-roots.mjs` on the moved packets by hand. This was seen once, on a test track with invalid graph metadata.\n   222\t\n   223\t&nbsp;\n   224\t\n   225\t## Upgrade Notes\n   226\t\n   227\t- **Everyone:** No migration required. Search and validation act as before without the new flag.\n   228\t- **Moving a packet:** Run `relocate.mjs` from the repository root as a dry run first. Commit your work on the paths it touches before `--apply`.\n   229\t- **Scripts that read `create.sh` stderr:** Expect one more line on some tracks. Stdout is unchanged.\n   230\t- **Scripts that predict the next packet number:** Count the numbers in `z_archive/` too.\n   231\t- **Sub-tracks you declared by hand:** Run `refresh-track-roots.mjs --apply` to create a missing `z_archive/`.\n   232\t- **After an archive or a restore:** Check `git status`. Commit or drop any rewritten `description.json`.\n=== goal log actual ===\n136:| 009-proposal-search-and-routing | Done | `242c719451` (A11, A12) and `0701a31ae5` (B7). B8 accepted as a known miss by the operator (decision Q014). Full CLI suite 2599 passed, advisor suite 1716 passed |\n137:| 010-real-pipeline-tests | Done | `5d84ff0e25`. A10 closed. New suite 4 passed, fails on the migrate mutant. Full CLI suite 2603 passed, 0 failed |\n138:| Criteria re-proved 2026-11-14 after 006 to 010 | Done | 1: real pipeline suite applies a map twice and resumes after a failed late step, through the true writers in a temp repository. 2: suggest-subtracks cases feed the printed map to the relocate preflight, exit 1. 3: the find prints 40 on the worktree, archive-numbering and phase numbering cases pass. 4: an archive-only sentence gives 0 paths without the flag, 1 with it and archivedPaths 1. 5: renumber cases leave no old folder name in the parent spec.md. 6: npm test 2603 passed, 0 failed, and the real pipeline suite exits 1 against the migrate mutant. 7: see validation |\n"}
