ainability pass should name the structural cause so the same drift does not recur.\n- Required evidence: `changelog/v2.13.0.0.md`, feature catalog root and leaf, manual playbook scenario 492, root/skill/command READMEs, and the suite inventory.'''\nnew = '''- Dimension: final cross-check\n- Focus area: verify every earlier P1 still has a live, precise file:line; classify surfaces with no change and confirm docs that need no change.\n- Reason: four dimensions are covered, active P1s remain, and the packet is at its last scheduled pass before synthesis.\n- Required evidence: registry, iteration narratives, current command README, and final manifest inventory.'''\nassert old in s\ns = s.replace(old, new)\np.write_text(s)\nprint('updated')\nPY","description":"Update strategy after iteration 4"}}
